{"architectures":["x64","x86"],"id":"NextDNS.NextDNS.CLI","latestVersion":"1.49.0","media":{"icons":[],"screenshots":[]},"package":{"description":"NextDNS CLI is a DNS53 to DNS-over-HTTPS (DoH) proxy with advanced capabilities to get the most out of the NextDNS service.","license":"MIT","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/nextdns/nextdns/blob/HEAD/LICENSE","locale":"en-US","localizations":{"en-US":{"description":"NextDNS CLI is a DNS53 to DNS-over-HTTPS (DoH) proxy with advanced capabilities to get the most out of the NextDNS service.","license":"MIT","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/nextdns/nextdns/blob/HEAD/LICENSE","locale":"en-US","longDescription":"NextDNS CLI is a DNS53 to DNS-over-HTTPS (DoH) proxy with advanced capabilities to get the most out of the NextDNS service.\nAlthough the most advanced features will only work with NextDNS, this program can work as a client for any DoH provider or a mix of NextDNS + another DNS (split horizon).\nThe CLI is mostly aimed at routers and UNIX based systems, but it is also a great client for windows and macOS for people who prefer a fully open-source clients and don't mind the lack of GUI.\n","moniker":"nextdns-cli","name":"NextDNS CLI","packageUrl":"https://github.com/nextdns/nextdns","publisher":"NextDNS","publisherUrl":"https://nextdns.io/","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/nextdns/nextdns/releases/tag/v1.49.0","tags":["dns","dns-over-https","dns53","doh-proxy","nextdns","proxy"]}},"longDescription":"NextDNS CLI is a DNS53 to DNS-over-HTTPS (DoH) proxy with advanced capabilities to get the most out of the NextDNS service.\nAlthough the most advanced features will only work with NextDNS, this program can work as a client for any DoH provider or a mix of NextDNS + another DNS (split horizon).\nThe CLI is mostly aimed at routers and UNIX based systems, but it is also a great client for windows and macOS for people who prefer a fully open-source clients and don't mind the lack of GUI.\n","moniker":"nextdns-cli","name":"Ne